	(text "AIN1 ADC (U901): 16-bit ADC, the bottom of the divider, filter and clamp"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 12.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9d082d91-0f13-5352-92de-acacd8f0d6b1")
	)
	(text_box "WHAT IT DOES\nU901 (ADS1115) is a 16-bit analog-to-digital converter: it measures the divided AIN1 voltage on its input AIN0 and the\nESP32 reads the result over I2C (address 0x48). R903 is the bottom of the AIN1 divider, C902 filters the signal and D901\nkeeps it between GND and 3.3 V if too much voltage arrives. The three unused ADC inputs are tied to GND.\n\nPINS OF THIS MODULE (its block on the top sheet)\nAIN1_ADC (in): divided AIN1 voltage from the AIN1 front end (R902): 2.73 V at 30 V on J1 pin 11\n+3V3 (in): supply from the 3.3 V regulator (ESP32 + USB module)\nI2C_SCL, I2C_SDA (both ways): the shared I2C bus to the ESP32 (pull-ups R211/R212 are in the IMU module)\nGND: ground\nPower and ground reach the parts on this sheet only through these pins: the ground and supply symbols drawn on this sheet are local to it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 17.78 0)
		(size 265 26.55)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1524)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "93e68ace-1fa0-5995-ad4b-91ca3d23c4a7")
	)
	(rectangle
		(start 127 83.82)
		(end 172.72 132.08)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1524)
			(type dash)
			(color 200 60 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(uuid "a0dd8c74-e093-5542-a170-c26674dfcab1")
	)
	(text "keep together on the PCB"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 127.6 84.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.0 1.0)
				(color 200 60 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "545d7806-cab5-5a5b-b294-1c638eeed5e6")
	)
	(text "C903 belongs to U901 pin 8 (VDD):\nwithin 2 mm of that pin, with a\nGND via beside its GND pad."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 175.26 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 200 60 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "66034ec0-870d-56fe-8ea2-88e10e33bb72")
	)
	(text "R903, C902 and D901 sit next to U901 pin 4 (AIN0):\nthe filter works only if it is close to the input."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 71.12 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 200 60 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c6eb41bc-374d-50d8-a5c0-83d8607b9311")
	)
	(text_box "PARTS AND THEIR JOBS\nU901: ADS1115 16-bit ADC with a programmable amplifier (MSOP-10). ADDR to GND = I2C address 0x48. AIN0 measures AIN1; AIN1-AIN3 unused (to GND); ALERT/RDY not used.\nR903: 10k 0.1 %: bottom of the AIN1 divider (top: R901 + R902 in the AIN1 front end). Ratio 0.0911: 30 V at J1 -> 2.73 V here.\nC902: 100 nF: with the divider's 9.1 kOhm it filters AIN1 (about 0.9 ms) and holds the charge the ADC takes when it samples.\nD901: BAV99 dual diode: clamps AIN0 between GND - 0.7 V and 3.3 V + 0.7 V. Silicon diodes leak only nanoamps, so they do not disturb small readings.\nC903: 100 nF decoupling for U901 VDD (pin 8)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 156 0)
		(size 155 20.4)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1524)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b93cfd70-2ab2-55c2-837f-2dab12b0fb9f")
	)
